{"v":4,"catch":"你有能力拯救吉姆並讓他離目標更近一步嗎？","desc":"Jim's Adventure 是一款遊戲，你需要跟隨美洲原住民 Jim 展開激動人心且具有挑戰性的冒險。 他正在探索一個充滿危險的大世界，從各種生物到障礙物，都試圖阻止他。 有許多級別要完成，而吉姆的生命數量非常有限。\n\n每個級別都有相當多的挑戰，並且有多個遊戲世界，從鬧鬼的森林到沙漠、洞穴等等。\n\n特徵：\n100 多個具有挑戰性的關卡\n身臨其境，快節奏和有趣的遊戲\n令人興奮的平台遊戲\n美麗的視覺效果\n避開生物和障礙物","publisher":"Gametry","release":"2022-04-21","genres":["街機","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1fb218e86af29b69fe774b4ee645703c6c5b03cb262326779ded2820f56ea7e9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7c3b043d452a0a3fabe7e8abc5bd8268092055c65b3322e5ec20c48fec9bedda.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4f49a254fe00f76a4d6634bfd60b7032f288359ae9a883b7e9ea8cd1dda038a3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5be716ab63e54e43e51603e127061161f89de37dbf40fd4db8188dfbedb1f5ce.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7b8643be0fda8ccd7f1b0209f9ffff4a5d99b7b7232af62b727f0e51c36fada1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a9e9d59acf740d3646aa965891b729c6a6251cbfe5bae9c9d928931b36592543.jpg"],"titleId":"0100fbc0181e0000","dlc":[]}